---
sequenceDiagram
  actor User as API user
  participant Control as OCC / State
  participant Compute as Compute owner
  participant Workload as Workload Pod
  participant Proxy as Go proxy Pod
  participant DNS as Trusted resolver
  participant Origin as Allowed origin

  Note over User,Origin: Proposed C1 request lifecycle<br/>C3 separately adds protected identity and operation authority
  Note over User,Compute: 1. Admit exact policy before resource effects
  User->>Control: Deploy Agent with egress selection
  Control->>Control: Authorize Agent and referenced resources
  Control->>Compute: Resolve exact runtime/network support
  Compute-->>Control: Admitted snapshot or denied/unsupported
  alt Selection is denied or unsupported
    Control-->>User: Refuse before resource construction
  else Selection resolves
    Control->>Control: Atomically freeze revision,<br/>admission fact and reconcile intent
    Note over Control,Compute: Unknown acceptance recovers through its original owner
    Note over Compute,Proxy: 2. Prepare separate proxy and confined workload
    Control->>Compute: Reconcile frozen revision
    Compute->>Compute: Validate snapshot and Driver<br/>Reauthorize before dispatch
    Compute->>Proxy: Exact binding, config and prepared leaf material
    Proxy->>Proxy: Strict decoding and complete trust validation<br/>before listeners
    Compute->>Workload: Establish restrictions, resolver and public trust
    Note over Compute,Workload: Readiness requires admitted generation and the real probe<br/>First-untrusted-instruction containment remains a proposal
    Note over Workload,DNS: 3. Admit DNS before returning the proxy address
    Workload->>Proxy: Original DNS question
    Proxy->>Proxy: Authorize canonical original name
    Proxy->>DNS: Bounded lookup at fixed endpoint
    DNS-->>Proxy: Answer set
    Proxy->>Proxy: Validate entire set and commit vetted numeric peers
    Proxy-->>Workload: Proxy address after binding commit
    Note over Workload,Origin: 4. Verify TLS and each HTTP request
    Workload->>Proxy: TLS SNI and HTTP request
    Proxy->>Proxy: Exact origin, method, path and query<br/>Reject ambiguous framing or tunnels
    Proxy->>Origin: Numeric-peer TLS with original ServerName
    Origin-->>Proxy: Upstream certificate chain
    Proxy->>Proxy: Verify independent roots and exclude interception keys
    Proxy->>Origin: Fresh admitted application request
    Origin-->>Proxy: Bounded streamed response
    Proxy-->>Workload: Stream permitted result
    Note over Compute,Workload: Actual authentication probe must pass before Ready<br/>Model and approved tool requests use the same checks
    Note over Compute,Origin: 5. Withdraw admission before awaited cleanup
    Compute->>Proxy: Owned lifecycle shutdown or retirement
    Proxy->>Proxy: Refuse new work, cancel requests and close sockets
    Proxy-->>Workload: Closed stream or bounded refusal
    Note over Proxy,Origin: Possibly dispatched effects remain uncertain<br/>Closed stream never permits mutation replay
    Compute->>Compute: Observe exact proxy UID termination<br/>Pending or unknown is not completion
    Compute-->>Control: Safe observed or pending outcome
    Control-->>User: Attributable status without secret material
  end
